(2187, 'Corsica Cushion Crescent Ottoman Bench', 'tropitone-660908c50', '660908C50', '<p>Perhaps the most versatile piece in the Tropitone® Corsica Cushion Collection, the Corsica Cushion Crescent Ottoman Bench can be used as a footrest, extra seating, and setting for trays of appetizers. The Corsica Cushion Crescent Ottoman Bench utilizes RELAXplus® cushion technology for optimal comfort. Pair this outdoor ottoman with Corsica Crescent Outdoor Furniture to create a complete gathering place for friends and family.</p>', NULL, 25, 41, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:58.723Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:36.830Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"26\"","Width":"49\"","Height":"16\"","Seat Height":"16\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2188, 'Corsica Woven Dining Chair', 'tropitone-161537ws', '161537WS', '<p>The Corsica Woven Dining Chair is crafted from durable powder-coated aluminum and features flowing curves and end-of-arm rolled detailing. The high-back design and woven bucket delivers sink-in comfort while providing head support. Featuring the beautiful Bison Weave, the Corsica Woven Dining Chair creates a simple and refined culinary setting.</p>', NULL, 25, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:58.728Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.617Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"29\"","Width":"25\"","Height":"37\"","Arm Height":"23.5\"","Seat Height":"17\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2189, 'Corsica Woven High Back Dining Chair', 'tropitone-161501ws', '161501WS', '<p>The Corsica Woven High Back Dining Chair is crafted from durable powder-coated aluminum and features flowing curves and end-of-arm rolled detailing. The high-back design and woven bucket delivers sink-in comfort while providing head support. The woven bucket is created with back and seat pieces that meet in a mitered joint and draws one into the chair. Featuring the beautiful Bison Weave, the Corsica Woven High Back Dining Chair creates a simple and refined culinary setting.</p>', NULL, 25, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:58.733Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.617Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"27\"","Width":"25\"","Height":"43\"","Arm Height":"23.5\"","Seat Height":"17\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
