(3275, 'Seaside Teak Dining Chair', 'seaside-teak-dining-chair-nc', 'NC2170DC', '<ul>
  <li>Plush bull nose cushions in the sunbrella fabric provide unmatched fade, moisture and mildew resistance</li>
  <li>Responsibly harvested solid plantation-grown teak. The teak plantation participates in a replenished forestry program and plants 1 tree for each tree that is harvested.</li>
  <li>You may choose to allow your natural wood/teak to weather to a beautiful silver-gray patina or treat it with an oil or sealer specifically made for natural teak twice a year to preserve the natural teak’s golden finish.</li>
  <li>Frame Material: Teak</li>
  <li>Cushions Included: Yes</li>
  <li>Product Care: Easily clean cushions with mild soap and water for an enduringly pristine surface. Air dry only.</li>
  <li>Assembly Required: Yes</li>
  
  
  <li>Weight Capacity: 270 lbs.</li>
</ul>', 'Dining Chair with Sunbrella Cushions features artisan craftsmanship in 100% solid, plantation-grown teak. The naturally weather-resistant teak is smoothly sanded and may be oiled to preserve the warm look as shown, or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Hardware is zinc-coated steel that has been plated in brass. The zinc helps minimize corrosion, steel was chosen for strength and brass for its luster. Also included are cushions covered in fade and mildew-resistant sunbrella® fabric. Turn your patio into a lavish outdoor lounge with this artfully designed teak seating set.', 17, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:15.630Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-24T00:23:41.213Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Seat Cushion Thickness":"2.5\"","Seat Height Without Cushion":"16\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Seaside","Teak","Dining Chairs"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Seaside', 'seaside', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dining Chair', NULL, NULL),
(3276, 'Universal Armless Dining Chair', 'universal-armless-dining-chair-nc', 'NC415DCS', '<ul>
  <li>High-Density Polyethylene (HDPE) all-weather wicker is infused with UV inhibitors that prevent fading and cracking ordinarily caused by sunlight.</li>
  <li>Wicker design gives it a more tactile, luxurious look and texture.</li>
  <li>Thick-gauged, powder-coated aluminum frame offers long lasting durability and rust resistance.</li>
  <li>Sunbrella® cushion covers provide unmatched fade, moisture and mildew resistance, and can be easily unzipped for cleaning.</li>
  <li>Seat cushion is made from quick-drying polyurethane foam wrapped in moisture and mildew-eliminating Dacron fibers.</li>
  <li>Full-sized design provides deep, comfortable seating. Compare dimensions to lesser brands to see the difference!</li>
  <li>Includes 2 back ties to hold cushion in place on Armless Dining Chair</li>
</ul>', 'The sleek and stylish Universal Armless Dining Chair makes outdoor dining a luxury experience. The UV-protected wicker sports a woven design, creating a contemporary look with clean lines. This dining side chair includes a fade- and mildew-resistant Sunbrella® seat cushion only.', 17, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:15.767Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-24T00:23:41.213Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Universal","Woven","Dining Chairs"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Universal', 'universal', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dining Chair', NULL, NULL),
(3277, 'Universal Dining Chair', 'universal-dining-chair-nc', 'NC415DC', '<ul>
