  <li>Hardware is zinc-coated steel that has been plated in brass. The zinc helps minimize corrosion, steel was chosen for strength and brass for its luster.</li>
  <li>Plantation-grown teak is harvested from mature trees that are part of a replenished forestry program</li>
  <li>Base Material: Teak</li>
  <li>Top Color: Light Yellow</li>
  <li>Base Color: Light Yellow</li>
  <li>Seating Capacity When Fully Extended: 6</li>
  <li>Seating Capacity When Fully Collapsed: 8</li>
  <li>Table Mechanism: Drop Leaf</li>
  
  
  
  
  <li>Assembly Required: Yes</li>
  <li>Top Material: Teak</li>
  <li>Top Material Details: Plantation-grown teak</li>
</ul>', 'This teak extension dining table is the perfect size to seat up to 8 adults around. This naturally weather-resistant hardwood may be maintained to preserve the warm look as shown or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Plantation-grown teak.', 17, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, '67/87"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:24.030Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-24T00:23:41.213Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Leaf Length End to End":"20\"","Leaf Width Side to Side":"41\"","Overall length when fully extended":"87\"","Overall length when fully collapsed":"67\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Universal Teak","Teak","Dining Tables"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Jameson', 'jameson', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dining Tables', NULL, NULL),
