  <li>Plush cushions with 2 small back buttons that can be unzipped in Sunbrella® fabric.</li>
  <li>CUSH600O-REC: 1 pc. cushion</li>
  
</ul>', 'The pieces in the Edgewater Collection are specially-sized to fit well in smaller spaces, allowing more seating room for your guests. This set features a 14mm resin finish with a half round design that combines with a rich, multi-toned finish on the frame and legs. The rich brown wicker is made from High-Density Polyethylene..', 17, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:40.362Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-24T00:23:41.213Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Seat Size":"22\" x 20\", Deck ht: 12.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Edgewater","Woven","Ottomans"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Edgewater', 'edgewater', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ottomans', NULL, NULL),
(3355, 'Grand Stafford Rectangular Ottoman', 'grand-stafford-rectangular-ottoman-nc', 'NC4331O-REC', '<ul>
  <li>Thick-gauged, powder-coated aluminum frame finish offers long lasting durability and rust resistance.</li>
  <li>High-Density Polyethylene (HDPE) all-weather wicker is infused with UV inhibitors that prevent fading and cracking ordinarily caused by sunlight..</li>
  <li>High-back design with plush headrest-style cushion provide the ultimate in comfort</li>
  <li>Sunbrella® cushion covers provide unmatched fade, moisture and mildew resistance, and can be easily unzipped for cleaning.</li>
</ul>', 'The Grand Stafford Collection combines a high-back design with plush headrest-style cushions to provide the ultimate in comfort. The set is supported by thick-gauged, powder-coated aluminum frames that make it extremely durable and resistant to corrosion. Also included are plush, headrest-style cushions.', 17, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '31.5" x 22" x 16" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:40.693Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-24T00:23:41.213Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Size":"31.5\" x 22\" x 16\" ht.","Seat Size":"24\" X 22\", Deck ht: 12\"","Fits Furniture Cover":"FC084"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Grand Stafford","Woven","Ottomans"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Grand Stafford', 'grand', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ottomans', NULL, NULL),
(3357, 'Laguna Teak Ottoman', 'laguna-teak-ottoman-nc', 'NC2015O', '<ul>
  <li>Sunbrella® cushion covers provide unmatched fade, moisture and mildew resistance, and can be easily unzipped for cleaning.</li>
  <li>Because the wood is reclaimed, it has already been aged and dried so there is no need for an additional step to control moisture.</li>
  <li>Plush, overstuffed cushions are made from quick-drying polyurethane foam wrapped in moisture and mildew-eliminating Dacron fibers.</li>
  <li>Hardware is zinc-coated steel that has been plated in brass. The zinc helps minimize corrosion, steel was chosen for strength and brass for its luster.</li>
  <li>Our Plantation Teak products ae plantation-grown and harvested from mature trees that are 50-60 years old.</li>
  <li>This line of teak is part of a replenished forestry program, where a new tree is planted for each one that is harvested.</li>
  <li>Grade B Teak.</li>
  <li>You may choose to allow your natural teak to weather to a beautiful silver-gray patina or treat it with an oil or sealer specifically made for natural teak twice a year to preserve the natural wood/teak’s golden finish.</li>
  <li>Natural teak may be cleaned using a wood cleaner, or lightly sanded with 600 (or higher) grit sandpaper.</li>
