(3938, 'Anthem Cushion Chat Chair', 'anthem-cushion-chat-chair', '7237A-DC', 'Homecrest''s Anthem cushion collection showcases bent aluminum extrusions and minimal welded joints, offering both aesthetic appeal and robust durability. The design features gentle curves and cushions with DreamCore technology, reflecting Homecrest''s heritage of metal bending and uniquely comfortable seating. Anthem exemplifies the American-made craftsmanship for which our company is renowned.', '', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:31.381Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-10T21:44:19.769Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"D":"32\"","H":"35\"","W":"28.5\"","Arm Ht":"23\"","Seat Ht":"18\"","Material":"DreamCore Cushion | Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Anthem Cushion', 'cushion', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
