(3954, 'Blair Air Armless Chat Chair', 'blair-air-armless-chat-chair', '51AR352', 'The Blair air collection features the look and feel of a deep seating piece in a foam-free, cushionless construction. Luxurious Sensation sling fabric is used for the ultimate in low-maintenance comfort and also features benefits such as exceptional shape retention and surface memory. Blair air offers a versatile, stylish, and durable solution for your outdoor seating needs and coordinates with all Blair sling pieces. Like Blair before it, Blair air''s light and fresh visual style lends itself to a wide variety of design aesthetics. But, because of its seating design, it performs especially well in climates with even the most intense rainfall.', '', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '26.5" W x 33" D x 36" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:33.923Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-10T22:28:30.103Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"D":"33\"","H":"36\"","W":"26.5\"","Arm Ht":"N/A","Seat Ht":"18\"","Material":"Sensation Sling | Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Blair Air', 'blair-air', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
