(4013, 'Edge Air Armless Swivel Chat Chair', 'edge-air-armless-swivel-chat-chair', '51AR902N', 'Armless Swivel Chat Chair — Homecrest Edge Air collection.

<p>Edge air provides the luxurious comfort of deep seating with a modern, foam-free innovation. Air technology''s cushionless construction allows for low-maintenance, quick-drying convenience, even in climates with the most intense rainfall. These armless pieces exhibit sleek, contemporary appeal, making them suitable for a wide range of design aesthetics.</p>', 'Armless Swivel Chat Chair — Homecrest Edge Air collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '26.5" W x 33" D x 36" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:43.098Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.713Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Notes":"Arm Ht: N/A","Material":"Sensation Sling | Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Edge Air', 'air', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4014, 'Elements Low Back Dining Chair', 'elements-low-back-dining-chair', '51680', 'Low Back Dining Chair — Homecrest Elements collection.

<p>Uniquely transitional and highly functional, Homecrest’s Elements sling collection is an industry favorite. Subtle curves and clean angles combine to create a collection that can be artfully classic or freshly modern, depending on your design sensibilities and your outdoor space. Available in low back, high back, and balcony seating, Elements has the added versatility of complementing a wide range of deep seating styles with ease. Elements comes in low back, high back, balcony options, and more. This, in combination with its adaptable style, makes it highly suitable for homeowners who value versatility, as well as commercial environments such as hotel lounges, rooftop bars, and beyond.</p>', 'Low Back Dining Chair — Homecrest Elements collection.', 16, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, '26" W x 28.5" D x 37" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:43.281Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.719Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Notes":"Padded Sling SKU: 51690","Material":"Sling | Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Elements', 'elements', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
