(4019, 'Elements Air Chat Chair', 'elements-air-chat-chair', '51AR392', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Elements Air collection.

<p>The Elements air collection features the appearance and comfort of deep seating in a foam-free, cushionless construction. Luxurious Sensation sling fabric is used for the ultimate in low-maintenance comfort and also features benefits such as exceptional shape retention and surface memory. Homecrest''s double layer sling design is extremely comfortable and field replaceable. Elements offers a versatile, stylish, and low-maintenance solution for your outdoor seating needs. Elements air is the perfect collection for climates that experience high levels of rainfall. And, it achieves this practicality without sacrificing style: Elements air is a beautiful seating style that can make an outdoor space feel special. The comfortable double layer sling seating also secures Elements air as a prime option for environments where relaxation is the ultimate goal, such as lake cabin, poolside, fireside, or general lounge areas.</p>', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Elements Air collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '32.5" W x 33" D x 36" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:44.069Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.747Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Sling | Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Elements Air', 'air', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
