<p>Holly Hill cushion dining follows the design cues of our classic Holly Hill collection, evoking a sort of East Coast opulence with its high-backed, maritime-inspired design. It’s no wonder that Holly Hill cushion dining is a favorite amongst homeowners and designers; It blends comfort and style effortlessly, making it perfect for homeowners who love to entertain guests, as well as fine dining environments.</p>', 'High Back Swivel Rocker — Homecrest Holly Hill Cushion collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24.5" W x 30" D x 44" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:52.807Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.967Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Arm Height":"25.5\"","Seat Height":"20\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Holly Hill Cushion', 'cushion', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
