<p>Experience the ultimate in modern style, comfort, and luxury with our In-Pool Series lounger with 12” risers. This innovative lounger works in up to 17” of water and will transform your poolside relaxation time. It features an ergonomic design for all to enjoy and comes with an optional head pillow for added comfort. This lounger is designed to be compatible with various types of pools, and its smooth surface and rounded edges prevent harm to delicate surfaces. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', 'Lounger with 12" Riser (2 Pack) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:55.318Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.033Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4094, 'In-Pool Series Hex Lounge Bench (Stackable)', 'in-pool-series-hex-lounge-bench-stackable', 'SPL41007AX', '19.25" x 21.85" Hex Lounge Bench (Stackable) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>You’ll never run out of seating options with our In-Pool Series 13” hex lounge bench. Whether you need extra seats on your pool ledge or a few more settings for a backyard barbecue, this portable, cushioned seat offers a modern geometric style that is perfect for your space. The hex lounge bench is lightweight with an open bottom and dual handles for effortless placement. It sits still in up to 7” of water and is stackable for convenient storage. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '19.25" x 21.85" Hex Lounge Bench (Stackable) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:55.449Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.036Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4095, 'In-Pool Series Hex Bench (Stackable)', 'in-pool-series-hex-bench-stackable', 'SPL41007MX', '19.25" x 21.85" Hex Bench (Stackable) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>You’ll never run out of seating options with our In-Pool Series 15.5” hex lounge bench. Whether you need extra seats on your pool ledge or a few more settings for a backyard barbecue, this portable, cushioned seat offers a modern geometric style that is perfect for your space. The hex lounge bench is lightweight with an open bottom and dual handles for effortless placement. It sits still in up to 8” of water and is stackable for convenient storage. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '19.25" x 21.85" Hex Bench (Stackable) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:55.581Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.040Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4096, 'In-Pool Series Hex Tall Bench (Stackable)', 'in-pool-series-hex-tall-bench-stackable', 'SPL41007BX', '19.25" x 21.85" Hex Tall Bench (Stackable) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>You’ll never run out of seating options with our In-Pool Series 18” hex lounge bench. Whether you need extra seats on your pool ledge or a few more settings for a backyard barbecue, this portable, cushioned seat offers a modern geometric style that is perfect for your space. The hex lounge bench is lightweight with an open bottom and dual handles for effortless placement. It sits still in up to 10” of water and is stackable for convenient storage. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '19.25" x 21.85" Hex Tall Bench (Stackable) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:55.716Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.044Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4097, 'In-Pool Series Sun Shelf Bench', 'in-pool-series-sun-shelf-bench', 'SPL11501', 'Sun Shelf Bench — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Whether it’s for a quiet poolside sanctuary or your favorite party spot, our In-Pool Series sun shelf bench complements any space with its modern design. Crafted without sharp corners or edges, the sun shelf bench sets the mood and embodies a sense of smooth elegance. Its construction creates a visually light appearance while ensuring stability, and the seats nest together for more compact storage. This piece stays stationary in up to 7” of water. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', 'Sun Shelf Bench — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:55.852Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.047Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4098, 'In-Pool Series Side Table/Bench', 'in-pool-series-side-table-bench', 'SPL22101T1', '22" x 17" Side Table/Bench — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Our In-Pool Series side table/bench is the ultimate pool accent, designed to combine functionality, versatility, and visual charm. Whether you use it as a seat, side table, or ottoman, this piece is a must-have for poolside relaxation. It features two built in cupholders for easy drink access, and it works in up to 10” of water without additional weights. Coated diving weights can be added through the cupholder opening to increase water depth to 13”. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '22" x 17" Side Table/Bench — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '22" W x 17" D x 16.25" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:55.970Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.050Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Notes":"SPL22101T1ST - with Soft Touch; Maximum water depth of 10\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4099, 'In-Pool Series Coffee Table/Bench', 'in-pool-series-coffee-table-bench', 'SPL11601UM', '18" x 47" Coffee Table/Bench — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>With impressive dimensions of 47" long, 18" wide, and a comfortable seat height of 16.5", our In-Pool Series coffee table/bench offers ample space for relaxation. It features handy cupholders for convenience, as well as an umbrella hole to ensure easy relief from the sun’s rays. This coffee table/bench is an excellent addition to all poolside applications, and it works in water depths up to 10". Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '18" x 47" Coffee Table/Bench — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:56.122Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.053Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4100, 'In-Pool Series Side Table', 'in-pool-series-side-table', 'SPLSIDETABLE', '15.5" Side Table — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Adaptive and stylish, our In-Pool Series side table brings modern flexibility to your outdoor living space. Designed with ingenuity and practicality in mind, this sturdy, multifunctional side table doubles as a trendy seat or ottoman when you need extra seating for your gathering. This side table works in up to 10” of water without additional weight, or add optional coated diving weights to increase that depth to 15”. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '15.5" Side Table — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:56.248Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.056Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4101, 'In-Pool Series End Table', 'in-pool-series-end-table', 'SPLWIDETABLE', '22.5" End Table — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Featuring an intelligent two-piece design and an umbrella hole, our In-Pool Series end table offers a convenient place for your refreshments in the shade. This end table boasts a unique rippled design that mimics the gentle flow of water, creating a visually captivating accent piece. Consisting of a sturdy base unit and removable top tray, this table works in water depths up to 10”. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '22.5" End Table — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '22.5" W x 22.5" D x 19" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:56.379Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.148Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Notes":"SPLWIDETABLEST - with Soft Touch; Maximum water depth of 10\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4102, 'In-Pool Series Portable Seat Pad', 'in-pool-series-portable-seat-pad', 'SPLRP1UNIT', 'Portable Seat Pad — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Our In-Pool Series portable seat pad is a waterproof, weatherproof cushion that provides much-needed, versatile poolside comfort. Available in Anthracite Grey, Light Blue, and Violet color options, the portable seat pad is made of the same high-quality material found in the cushioned soles of athletic shoes. It is durable, easy to clean, and remarkably soft, acting as a protective barrier that insulates you from hot, cold, or dirty seating surfaces. Available in Anthracite Grey, Light Blue, and Violet color options.</p>', 'Portable Seat Pad — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:56.501Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.151Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4103, 'In-Pool Series 4" Riser Set Only', 'in-pool-series-4-riser-set-only', 'SPL33104', '4" Riser Set Only — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>All In-Pool products are available in a variety of colors and are suitable for use in both chlorinated and saltwater pools, as well as on all pool materials like concrete, vinyl liners, and gunite. They can be easily removed from the pool to be used on the pool deck. Each product has a recommended maximum water depth for best performance. • Maximum water depth of 9" • Average thickness of material to be .20” or greater • Waterproof, rustproof, and 100% recyclable • Suitable for both indoor and year-round outdoor use • Products tested to support up to 750 lbs • Fully compounded color (not dry blended) with UV light stabilizer to increase longevity of color retention in direct sunlight applications Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', '4" Riser Set Only — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:56.629Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.154Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'In-Pool Series', 'series', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
