(4120, 'Manhattan Armless Dining Chair (Stackable)', 'manhattan-armless-dining-chair-stackable', 'CH590-CH', 'Armless Dining Chair (Stackable) — Homecrest Manhattan collection.

<p>Our Manhattan collection is urbane. It’s practical. It’s cosmopolitan. It is sure to make any outdoor space feel both refined and bold. This collection features a full steel construction, ensuring its sturdy frame and bold grid detailing will outlast typical outdoor furniture by years. Manhattan is perfect for homeowners and designers who want to capture the aesthetic of sophisticated metropolitan environments. This collection is also especially well-suited to environments with limited space; we offer this collection in multiple stackable seating styles, with removable seat pad options.</p>', 'Armless Dining Chair (Stackable) — Homecrest Manhattan collection.', 16, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, '18.5" W x 21" D x 35" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:58.920Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.228Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Notes":"Metal Seat variant. Stackable: 2-6","Material":"Metal + Padded Seat | Steel"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Manhattan', 'manhattan', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
