(4124, 'Olive Armless Dining Chair', 'olive-armless-dining-chair', '1G350', 'Armless Dining Chair — Homecrest Olive collection.

<p>The Olive collection brings modern comfort and commercial-grade durability together in one clean, refined design. Its sleek, tubular aluminum frame is powder-coated for long-lasting performance, while the field-replaceable double layer sling seat and back make it a smart choice for high-use outdoor spaces. Available in dining, balcony, and bar heights, Olive makes it easy to create a polished, coordinated look across patios, pool decks, resorts, cafés, and other commercial settings.</p>', 'Armless Dining Chair — Homecrest Olive collection.', 16, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:59.459Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.245Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"22.6\"","Width":"20.6\"","Height":"30\"","Weight":"12 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Seat Height":"18\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Olive', 'olive', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
