(4162, 'Surf Center Chat Chair', 'surf-center-chat-chair', '24350', 'Center Chat Chair — Homecrest Surf collection.

<p>With an emphasis on contemporary design and practical style, the nature-inspired Surf collection is an excellent option for heavy-use areas such as gardens, parks, college or corporate campuses, and more. Surf’s powder-coated aluminum frame and curving HDPE seat offer unmatched durability, ensuring this modular collection will stand the test of time against the elements.</p>', 'Center Chat Chair — Homecrest Surf collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, '23.3" W x 34.5" D x 35" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:37:05.313Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.370Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Notes":"Arm Ht: N/A","Material":"All-Weather Poly | Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Surf', 'surf', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
