(4211, 'Mode Club Adjustable Table', 'mode-club-adjustable-table', '1330RMD', '30" Adjustable Table — Homecrest Mode Club collection.

<p>Building on our popular Mode collection, Homecrest''s Mode Club is a complementary series of contemporary table tops that are uniquely designed for hospitality applications. Mode Club tables feature clean lines and smooth contours in a variety of shapes and sizes that are specifically selected for outdoor spaces in public places. Like its sister collection, Mode Club tops are available in DuoTone color options. Pair these sophisticated tops with the Homecrest base that appropriately meets the height, functional, and aesthetic requirements of your project.</p>', '30" Adjustable Table — Homecrest Mode Club collection.', 16, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, '18.25-30.75" H', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:37:14.042Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:14:57.428Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Mode Club', 'club', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Coffee & Side Tables', NULL, NULL),
(4217, 'Table Bases End Post Table Base', 'table-bases-end-post-table-base', '5723B', 'End Post Table Base — Homecrest Table Bases collection.

