(4327, 'Slate Round Side Table 24" (3-Legged Base)', 'slate-round-side-table-24-3-legged-base-3724rsl-slate-homecrest', '3724RSL', 'A welcome addition to any outdoor space, Homecrest''s Slate tops feature a rustic elegance that could only be inspired by nature. Cast from the pattern and subtle texture of natural slate and produced using industry-leading technology, Homecrest Slate tops are as beautifully authentic in appearance as they are tough and durable. These smooth-surface tops are a favorite in outdoor spaces across the country and mix seamlessly with pieces from our seating collections.', '', 16, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, '15.5" H', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:37:34.177Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-08T21:45:47.411Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"24\"","Width":"24\"","Height":"15.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Slate', 'slate', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Coffee & Side Tables', NULL, NULL),
