(5177, 'Avana Crescent Sofa', 'owlee-avana-avana-crescent-sofa-65168-3s', '65168-3S', NULL, 'The Avana Crescent Sofa makes a statement without saying a word. With its sweeping crescent silhouette and sculptural frame, this piece is designed to anchor a space beautifully--whether gathered around a fire feature or positioned as a standalone focal point. The curved profile naturally encourages conversation, creating an intimate, inviting atmosphere while offering generous seating. Handcrafted with the signature quality and durability you expect from O.W. Lee, the Avana Crescent Sofa features a fully welded aluminum frame built to withstand the elements. Plush, tailored cushions provide exceptional comfort and long-lasting performance, available in a wide range of premium outdoor fabrics to suit any design vision. Elegant from every angle, the Avana Crescent Sofa blends refined lines with enduring construction—bringing both drama and comfort to luxury outdoor living spaces.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 223, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Avana"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","avana","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Avana', 'avana', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sofas', NULL, NULL),
(5178, 'Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair', 'owlee-avana-padded-sling-dining-arm-chair-65192p-a', '65192P-A', NULL, 'The O.W. Lee Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair brings modern elegance and comfort to any outdoor dining space. Its cushioned sling seat combines with a clean-lined aluminum frame to create a chair that feels refined, inviting, and perfectly suited for everyday use. Designed with both style and practicality in mind, it’s a great choice for those who want high-quality outdoor furniture at a more accessible price point without sacrificing design or durability. Quality & Customization Built with O.W. Lee’s legendary craftsmanship, this chair is made to last. The aluminum frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, ensuring long-lasting comfort and performance outdoors. Customization is effortless. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 durable sling fabrics, to create a look that fits your outdoor space perfectly. The Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair delivers style, comfort, and exceptional value, making it an ideal choice for customers seeking upscale outdoor dining at a smart price.', 13, 44, NULL, NULL, '18.00', NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 224, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.434Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Avana","weight_lbs":"18","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Avana_Retail_SpecSheet_2026_65192P-A-Padded-Sling-Dining-Arm-Chair.pdf"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","avana","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Avana', 'avana', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dining Chair', 'Sling', NULL),
