(5477, 'Phoenix 42" Round Chat Height Fire Pit', 'phoenix-42-round-chat-height-fire-pit', '5113-42RDC', NULL, 'The Phoenix Fire Pit redefines outdoor luxury with a bold, modern design and the unmatched durability of Dekton® — a premium ultra-compact surface known for its superior resistance to heat, scratches, and weather. Sophisticated and sleek, Phoenix is the perfect fusion of innovation, elegance, and enduring craftsmanship for any outdoor living space.', 13, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-22T17:14:25.453Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Phoenix', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
