(5483, 'Compass 54" Round Chat Height Fire Pit', 'compass-54-round-chat-height-fire-pit', '5160-54RDC', NULL, 'Introducing a bold innovation from O.W. Lee — our first-ever hearth surround designed specifically for the Breeo® wood-burning smokeless fire pit (X Series 24 Model). This exciting collaboration pairs Breeo''s advanced smokeless technology with O.W. Lee''s timeless craftsmanship and design expertise, creating a fire feature that''s as visually stunning as it is performance-driven.', 13, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-22T17:14:25.453Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Compass', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
