(5561, 'The Aurora Fiberglass', 'the-aurora-fiberglass', '868ARU-F', 'Maximize your space without a traditional center post. The Aurora Fiberglass is manufactured using the industry''s best materials and fabrics to provide many years of trouble-free use and enjoyment. Its Infinity Tilt allows you to change positions effortlessly. This modern cantilever is suitable for use in low to moderate wind conditions and ensures hours of protection from the sun and light rain.

Operation: 360 degree mast rotation with 16 locking positions every 22.5 degrees; Canopy Infinity Tilt for countless hours of maximum shade; automatic tilt locking for safety; smooth, commercially rated crank lift operation.

Ribs: solid .75 inch (19mm) fiberglass ribs.

Pole & Hardware: extruded aluminum mast; stainless steel hardware throughout; stainless steel screw and grommet canopy attachments.

Canopy Features: engineered to withstand sustained 30 mph winds; black polyester protective cover included.

