(5785, 'Timber Lounge Fire Table Round 42"', 'timber-lounge-fire-table-round-42', '42RTMFPTT+89RNC', 'Timber Fire Tables — Homecrest Timber collection.

<p>Individually handcrafted and cast from beautiful reclaimed wood tables, our Timber fire tables look incredibly realistic. Homecrest fire tables offer a powerful burner (up to 65,000 BTUs) and come standard with your choice of fire jewelry, as well as a secure key and black 3/4" aluminum fire burner riser.</p>', 'Timber Lounge Fire Table Round 42" — Homecrest Timber Fire Tables collection.', 16, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, '42" W x 42" D x 21.5" H', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-07-08T18:41:33.576Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-08T18:41:33.576Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"42\"","Width":"42\"","Height":"21.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
