(5851, 'Slate Round Side Table 24" (4-Legged Base)', 'slate-round-side-table-24-4-legged-base-3725rsl-slate-homecrest', '3725RSL', 'A welcome addition to any outdoor space, Homecrest''s Slate tops feature a rustic elegance that could only be inspired by nature. Cast from the pattern and subtle texture of natural slate and produced using industry-leading technology, Homecrest Slate tops are as beautifully authentic in appearance as they are tough and durable. These smooth-surface tops are a favorite in outdoor spaces across the country and mix seamlessly with pieces from our seating collections.', '', 16, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-07-08T21:11:23.659Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-08T21:11:23.659Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"24\"","Width":"24\"","Height":"15.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Slate', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
