(6018, 'Slate Lounge Fire Pit Rectangle 36" x 60"', 'slate-lounge-fire-pit-rectangle-36-x-60', '893660XSLTT+89XNC', 'Rustic yet elegant, Homecrest''s handcrafted Slate fire tables are a refreshing addition to any outdoor space. Featuring authentic patterns and subtle textures, these smooth-surface fire tables are cast from natural slate and are available in a variety of colors. Our Slate fire tables are as beautiful as they are durable. Homecrest fire tables feature powerful burners delivering up to 65,000 BTUs and are compatible with both natural gas and liquid propane. Each table includes a concealed fuel tank and comes standard with your choice of fire jewelry, a secure key, and a black 3/4" aluminum fire burner riser.', NULL, 16, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-07-09T00:15:39.349Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-09T00:15:39.349Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"60\"","Width":"36\"","Height":"21.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(6020, 'Timber Dining Table Round 42" No Hole', 'timber-dining-table-round-42in-no-hole-homecrest', '3742RFTMNU', 'Timber Tables — Homecrest Timber collection.

<p>Cast from beautiful reclaimed wood tables, our popular Timber collection is on trend and timeless. Using the same technology we use in all Natural Series tops, we are able to achieve a look that is marvelously realistic while retaining the outstanding outdoor performance characteristics you expect from Homecrest. Timber is available in a variety of authentic colors to coordinate with unique color themes.</p>', NULL, 16, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, '42" W x 42" D x 29.25" H', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-07-09T02:36:59.721Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-09T02:36:59.721Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"42\"","Width":"42\"","Height":"29.25\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
