(6113, 'Mode 44" Square Dining Table (no Hole)', 'mode-44-square-dining-table-no-hole-134444f-mode-homecrest', '134444F', 'Add an element of sophistication to your outdoor space with Homecrest''s Mode collection. With clean lines and contemporary inspiration, Mode sets the standard in casual chic. Mode features floating aluminum rectangular panels and a sleek appearance that brings an elegant style to your outdoor space. The aluminum top panels that float over the base frame are available in all finishes. DuoTone your Mode table or fire table by selecting one color for the top panels and a coordinating color for the base.', NULL, 16, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-07-09T19:39:36.023Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-09T19:39:36.023Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"44\"","Width":"44\"","Height":"30\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '{}'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Mode', 'mode', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dining Tables', NULL, NULL),
