(6238, 'Allure Armless Adjustable Chaise with Wheels (2 Pack)', 'allure-armless-adjustable-chaise-with-wheels-2-pack-11300-2-allure-homecrest', '11300-2', 'The clean lines of the Allure collection, met with the strength and durability of powder-coated aluminum, provide premium comfort. Allure features a field-replaceable double layer sling with no welting and carries an unprecedented sling warranty. The quick-drying dining, balcony, and bar units are available with or without arms. This collection is well suited for homeowners with a discerning eye for design, as well as poolside, rooftop, café and bar environments, and more.', '', 16, 42, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-07-10T20:44:18.228Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-10T20:44:18.228Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"H":"35\"","L":"77\"","W":"28\"","Notes":"Stackable: 2-6. Each order includes 2 chairs.","Arm Ht":"N/A","Seat Ht":"16\"","Material":"Sling | Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Allure', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
